**Every response:** log retrieval code (`INDEX_HIT_AI_CACHE` | `INDEX_HIT` | `INDEX_MISS` | `L_DRIVE_NOT_MOUNTED_IN_WSL` | failover codes). Index compact Hub slices before repo grep or explore subagents.

**Commands:** `npm run agent:index:scout -- --json` | `npm run agent:index:preflight -- --json`

**Hooks:** `sync:intelligence-hub-scout-hooks` → `agent-packs/three-way-agent/hooks/intelligence-hub-scout-inject.mjs`

